Subject: [PATCH] um: virtio_uml: disallow modular build
Date: Tue,  8 Oct 2019 17:43:21 +0200
Message-Id: <1570549401-Ia2c524a2c48a33cecd9d956898cebe358a37563d@changeid>
MIME-Version: 1.0
List-Id: <linux-um.lists.infradead.org>
